  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OPC framework Balkans 02</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OPC ramavtal Balkan 2002</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OPC:s ramavtal f&#xf6;r 2002 t&#xe4;cker samarbete med MR- och demokratiorganisationer p&#xe5; hela Balkan. OPC arbetar med bl a fackliga fr&#xe5;gor, kvinnoprojekt, ungdomar, IT samt MR-fr&#xe5;gor generellt. De s&#xf6;ker f&#xf6;r 33 projekt samt 1 MSEK f&#xf6;r tillkommande insatser. De skall detta &#xe5;r etablera f&#xe4;ltkontor i regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 2002 OPC framework agreement covers co-operation with human rights and democracy organisations all over the Balkans. OPC works with e g union issues, women&apos;s projects, youth, ICT and human rights in general. They have applied for 33 projects plus 1 MSEK for future projects. This year, they will establish a field presence in Serbia and Bosnia.</narrative>
  </description>
